        "edit": "Add the missing else branch so that when s is not 0 the mux selects b, fixing the inverted/incomplete select polarity that left y unassigned for s==1.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module mux21(a,b,s,y);\n\tinput a,b,s;\n\toutput y;\n\treg y;\n\talways @(a,b,s)\n\tbegin\n\t\tif(s==1'B0) begin y=a; end\n\t\telse begin y=b; end\n\tend\nendmodule",
